body: "Focused retry prerequisite: use Node 22.18+ or Node 24+ with built-in TypeScript type stripping enabled. Node 23.0–23.5 requires --experimental-strip-types. The recorded retry keeps its original target and test-name filter. This retry is historical evidence of intermittency, not proof that the broad-suite concurrency issue is resolved."
